# Lure of the Wildcat (San d'Oria) (sandoria 113): the guard xi.settings.main.ENABLE_TOAU == 1 (a number setting:
# settings/default/main.lua has 1, and survival_guide.lua multiplies it). 0, 2 and 1.25 (a fraction: Lua compares the
# number as it is, so 1.25 is not 1; a port that rounds the setting would offer it) are not 1: not offered, Amutiyaal's
# own script (816). Then 1: 812 (its finish gives the badge and begins it).
lists SouthernSanDoria/Amutiyaal/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/812
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=118.0,0.0,84.7 job=WAR lvl=20
setting ENABLE_TOAU 0
login
trigger Amutiyaal                         # ENABLE_TOAU 0: not offered; 816
finish
setting ENABLE_TOAU 2
trigger Amutiyaal                         # ENABLE_TOAU 2: not offered; 816
finish
setting ENABLE_TOAU 1.25
trigger Amutiyaal                         # ENABLE_TOAU 1.25: not offered; 816
finish
setting ENABLE_TOAU 1
trigger Amutiyaal                         # ENABLE_TOAU 1: 812
finish                                    # the Red Sentinel Badge; begun
